  "description": "WRITE-ALLOC, insert conflict granularity (every b insert was refused 3260 while a held an uncommitted insert, but b's insert was admitted while a had only updated rows). Process a BeginTrans and inserts T key 500. Process b tries with Errors before/after: INSERT into T (key 501), INSERT into U (another table), INSERT into C (AutoNumber table), UPDATE T row 64 (far row), UPDATE T row 1; a Rollback; b repeats the T insert; a reads. Asks whether the refusal is table-wide, tied to the append page, or tied to the key.",
